  "agent": {
    "note": "master — @m0saic/alpine/leaderboard/v1 (the 6th Alpine template), LOCKED 2026-06-22. A ranked list in the friendly white card: each row is a small rounded RANK BADGE + name + count-up value. Rows AUTO-SORT by value descending so rank reflects the score (preSorted keeps input order); caps at 8 rows. The podium gets the medal treatment — gold / dark-grey / brown badges with a soft tinted row wash; every other row a neutral grey wash so the top three read at a glance. Theme-aware: medal + wash colors retune for the dark preset (rank-2 = muted slate #64748B, not glaring) so nothing washes out or vanishes. Values format with thousands grouping ($284,000) via animateNumbersInText (grouped-digit padding fix shipped in template-utils so '$284,000' never renders '$284,0'); per-item Display override, valuePrefix/suffix, or raw label all supported. Built on the bar-graph/progress model (weighted splits + rounded tiles, no inline-masks); every height weight snapped to a multiple of 8 → feasible at any resolution (validated 1280x800 AND 1024x1024). 5 stress variants approved (A preSorted · B no-tint · C 8-rows-$ · D dark-toned · E long-names).",
    "question": "Locked master — showcase props (5 contributors, podium medal tint, count-up). This is the preview the Templates page renders.",
    "response": {
      "body": "Approved — locked.",
      "from": "human",
      "at": "2026-06-22T00:00:00.000Z"
    }
